    "created_at": "2018-02-22T20:39:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-22T20:39:39Z",
    "body": "One issue with Chrome's approach: if the other frame has already set document.domain but we have not yet, and we set href, then set document.domain, then set href again without returning to the event loop in between, the first set ends up async, the second ends up sync, and then we effectively \"lose\" that second set when the first one finally happens.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
