    "updated_at": "2019-05-28T23:20:29Z",
    "body": "We know for a fact not doing same-origin fragment navigation breaks major sites such as Gmail because we accidentally broke it recently.\r\n\r\nI think making all fragment navigation asynchronous is a non-starter.",
